0285a1e-a5cf-5cc8-a08b-5240464d9ec8" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325812 1145 "First, we find the scalar projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =|\\,a\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =6\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =6\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the unit vector that is parallel to $b:$\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{b}{|\\,b\\,|}=\\frac{b}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}b\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute the vector projection as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{b}\\,a & ={\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a\\cdot u \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}b \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{2}b\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325814 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325815 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325816 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325817 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1000 #edb/ref 17592186325818 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1041 "selection" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1104 #edb/ref 17592186325814 13194139535001 true] [17592186325813 1110 #uuid "485c6674-fab3-5f38-a6f9-36bf4a4f7ad4" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325814 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}b" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325814 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535001 true] [17592186325814 1111 #uuid "a40df457-c932-5555-aff1-534cb35483cd" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325815 1034 "\\sqrt{3}b" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325815 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535001 true] [17592186325815 1111 #uuid "ff9db31d-0a43-57c5-8e40-0f5a4e8ca713" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325816 1034 "b" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325816 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535001 true] [17592186325816 1111 #uuid "3817e669-6cf2-5e7b-9eb0-b8235840dbc7" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325817 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}b" 13194139535001 true] [17592186325817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131